{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":11,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 11:1"},"A false balance ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," abomination to the LORD: but a just weight ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," his delight. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 11:2"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["When"]}," pride cometh, then cometh shame: but with the lowly ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," wisdom. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 11:3"},"The integrity of the upright shall guide them: but the perverseness of transgressors shall destroy them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 11:4"},"Riches profit not in the day of wrath: but righteousness delivereth from death. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 11:5"},"The righteousness of the perfect shall direct his way: but the wicked shall fall by his own wickedness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 11:6"},"The righteousness of the upright shall deliver them: but transgressors shall be taken in ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["their own"]}," naughtiness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 11:7"},"When a wicked man dieth, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," expectation shall perish: and the hope of unjust ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["men"]}," perisheth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 11:8"},"The righteous is delivered out of trouble, and the wicked cometh in his stead. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 11:9"},"An hypocrite with ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," mouth destroyeth his neighbour: but through knowledge shall the just be delivered. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 11:10"},"When it goeth well with the righteous, the city rejoiceth: and when the wicked perish, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," shouting. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 11:11"},"By the blessing of the upright the city is exalted: but it is overthrown by the mouth of the wicked. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 11:12"},"He that is void of wisdom despiseth his neighbour: but a man of understanding holdeth his peace. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 11:13"},"A talebearer revealeth secrets: but he that is of a faithful spirit concealeth the matter. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 11:14"},"Where no counsel ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is,"]}," the people fall: but in the multitude of counsellors ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," safety. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 11:15"},"He that is surety for a stranger shall smart ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["for it:"]}," and he that hateth suretiship is sure. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 11:16"},"A gracious woman retaineth honour: and strong ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["men"]}," retain riches. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 11:17"},"The merciful man doeth good to his own soul: but ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["he that is "]},"cruel troubleth his own flesh. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 11:18"},"The wicked worketh a deceitful work: but to him that soweth righteousness ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall be"]}," a sure reward. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 11:19"},"As righteousness ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["tendeth"]}," to life: so he that pursueth evil ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["pursueth it"]}," to his own death. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 11:20"},"They that are of a froward heart ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," abomination to the LORD: but ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["such as are"]}," upright in ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["their"]}," way ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," his delight. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 11:21"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["Though"]}," hand ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["join"]}," in hand, the wicked shall not be unpunished: but the seed of the righteous shall be delivered. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 11:22"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["As"]}," a jewel of gold in a swine’s snout, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["so is"]}," a fair woman which is without discretion. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 11:23"},"The desire of the righteous ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," only good: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["but"]}," the expectation of the wicked ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," wrath. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 11:24"},"There is that scattereth, and yet increaseth; and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is "]},"that withholdeth more than is meet, but ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it tendeth"]}," to poverty. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PRO 11:25"},"The liberal soul shall be made fat: and he that watereth shall be watered also himself. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:25"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PRO 11:26"},"He that withholdeth corn, the people shall curse him: but blessing ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall be"]}," upon the head of him that selleth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it. "]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:26"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PRO 11:27"},"He that diligently seeketh good procureth favour: but he that seeketh mischief, it shall come unto him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:27"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PRO 11:28"},"He that trusteth in his riches shall fall: but the righteous shall flourish as a branch. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:28"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"29","sid":"PRO 11:29"},"He that troubleth his own house shall inherit the wind: and the fool ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall be"]}," servant to the wise of heart. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:29"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"30","sid":"PRO 11:30"},"The fruit of the righteous ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a tree of life; and he that winneth souls ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," wise. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:30"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"31","sid":"PRO 11:31"},"Behold, the righteous shall be recompensed in the earth: much more the wicked and the sinner. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 11:31"}]}]}
